# "Recent" in the sidebar, dark theme: the files used lately, the last used first.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/recenti.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo recenti ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/recenti.png"
Sleep 1s
